    $seed$Legal policies$seed$, $seed$Privacy Policy$seed$, $seed$This policy describes website privacy practices and contacts; all uses, including any marketplace processing, require verification before publication.$seed$, $seed$What personal data we collect, why, who sees it, and how to ask for access, correction or deletion.$seed$,
