    $seed$Legal policies$seed$, $seed$Return, Replacement and Damaged Goods Procedure$seed$, $seed$What to do when goods arrive damaged, short, wrong, expired or not as described. This procedure works together with the Cancellation, Return and Refund Policy.$seed$, $seed$Step-by-step procedure for damaged, short, wrong or expired goods.$seed$,
    'draft', $seed$1.0$seed$, date '2026-11-14', 50,
