    $seed$Legal policies$seed$, $seed$Seller Agreement$seed$, $seed$The agreement between Maharani Traders (the marketplace operator) and each independent seller who lists goods on this website. A seller must accept the current version before any offer can go live.$seed$, $seed$Duties of third-party sellers: registration, genuine goods, labelling, fulfilment, taxes and payouts.$seed$,
