    $seed$Legal policies$seed$, $seed$Product Authenticity and Safety Policy$seed$, $seed$Maharani Traders intends to source products through lawful suppliers and offer genuine products.$seed$, $seed$Genuine goods, labelling, expiry and how to report a safety concern.$seed$,
    'draft', $seed$1.0$seed$, date '2026-11-04', 120,
